// Brazilian Portuguese texts of the R(ust)PG2D runtime (menus, windows, HUD, messages).
// A draft made with AI help: corrections by native speakers are welcome. `{}` stands for a value
// (in order), `{0}`, `{1}` pick one. Keys are the exact English texts the game draws (see de.ron).
